<title>USA: O'Sullivan Industries posts Q3 profit.</title>
<headline>O'Sullivan Industries posts Q3 profit.</headline>
<dateline>LAMAR, Mo. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>O'Sullivan Industries Holdings Corp said Thursday solid sales gains, improved margins and cost controls helped the company post a profit in the third quarter ended March 31.</p>
<p>The maker of ready-to-assemble furniture reported net income of $3.9 million, or $0.23 a share, versus a loss of $2.9 million, or $0.17, in the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>Sales climbed to $77.5 million from $67.4 million, the company said.</p>
<p>O'Sullivan Industries shares closed off 1/4 Thursday at 14.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
